{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014p7xafNbNz8GaoUbnWmf7Z","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# GOAL\n2\t\n3\tExecute `N90_FINAL_AUDIT` after N50 and N60. Independently audit the frozen Plan\n4\t26 spec, implementation graph, QA criteria, all node results/hashes, production\n5\tcall graph, dependency environment, tests, and live proof status.\n6\t\n7\tDo not edit production code in this node. Classify every finding under exactly\n8\tone `rework_edges` key and owning node. Rework invalidates that node and all\n9\tdescendants, after which the runner resumes graph scheduling and later returns\n10\tto a fresh N90 audit.\n11\t\n12\t# TEST\n13\t\n14\t1. Every normative spec requirement maps to passing implementation evidence.\n15\t2. All graph nodes/results and declared artifacts/hashes are current and valid.\n16\t3. Exactly one compiled LangGraph production path exists; no LangChain wrapper or fallback.\n17\t4. Eight-job, authority, denominator, repair, persistence, resume, terminal, and CLI invariants pass.\n18\t5. Full adversarial/regression evidence is complete with no waived test.\n19\t6. `ACTIVATED` is allowed only when N60 has valid authorized live unit and full-release proof.\n20\t7. `IMPLEMENTED_NOT_ACTIVATED` is allowed only when N50 passed and N60 is\n21\t   `NOT_AVAILABLE` solely for recorded external prerequisites.\n22\t\n23\tWrite `results/N90_FINAL_AUDIT.result.v1.md` with finding-to-owner dispositions,\n24\tall hashes, and exactly one verdict: `ACTIVATED`,\n25\t`IMPLEMENTED_NOT_ACTIVATED`, or `BLOCKED`.\n26\t\n27\t# LOOP\n28\t\n29\tIf a blocking finding exists, emit its single rework key and owning node; do not\n30\trepair it here. The runner may traverse the same finding/root-cause rework edge\n31\ttwice. A third occurrence, ambiguous ownership, missing evidence, or impossible\n32\tlegal frontier produces `BLOCKED`. Never upgrade a verdict beyond its evidence.\n33\t\n34\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0307cd11-8c01-4a45-8d2f-da74afa560e3","uuid":"08a6abe9-de66-4de2-88fe-9bb2c4e6ba19","timestamp":"2026-08-13T00:29:13.718Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/filipepinto/Projects/curriculum_builder/.plan26-run/plan26/attempts/N90_FINAL_AUDIT/attempt-20260813T002841.066117Z-baf3aca859/repo/plans/26_langgraph_curriculum_factory/prompts/N90_final_audit.prompt.v1.md","content":"# GOAL\n\nExecute `N90_FINAL_AUDIT` after N50 and N60. Independently audit the frozen Plan\n26 spec, implementation graph, QA criteria, all node results/hashes, production\ncall graph, dependency environment, tests, and live proof status.\n\nDo not edit production code in this node. Classify every finding under exactly\none `rework_edges` key and owning node. Rework invalidates that node and all\ndescendants, after which the runner resumes graph scheduling and later returns\nto a fresh N90 audit.\n\n# TEST\n\n1. Every normative spec requirement maps to passing implementation evidence.\n2. All graph nodes/results and declared artifacts/hashes are current and valid.\n3. Exactly one compiled LangGraph production path exists; no LangChain wrapper or fallback.\n4. Eight-job, authority, denominator, repair, persistence, resume, terminal, and CLI invariants pass.\n5. Full adversarial/regression evidence is complete with no waived test.\n6. `ACTIVATED` is allowed only when N60 has valid authorized live unit and full-release proof.\n7. `IMPLEMENTED_NOT_ACTIVATED` is allowed only when N50 passed and N60 is\n   `NOT_AVAILABLE` solely for recorded external prerequisites.\n\nWrite `results/N90_FINAL_AUDIT.result.v1.md` with finding-to-owner dispositions,\nall hashes, and exactly one verdict: `ACTIVATED`,\n`IMPLEMENTED_NOT_ACTIVATED`, or `BLOCKED`.\n\n# LOOP\n\nIf a blocking finding exists, emit its single rework key and owning node; do not\nrepair it here. The runner may traverse the same finding/root-cause rework edge\ntwice. A third occurrence, ambiguous ownership, missing evidence, or impossible\nlegal frontier produces `BLOCKED`. Never upgrade a verdict beyond its evidence.\n\n","numLines":34,"startLine":1,"totalLines":34}}}
